  <section class="article-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Complete guide</span>
      <h1 id="page-title">Legal Ways to Get Stripchat Tokens: A Complete Guide</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        If you want Stripchat Tokens without risking your account or your money,
        there is exactly one safe approach: buy them yourself, through official
        channels, with careful habits around every transaction. This guide
        explains how that works in practice \u2014 from the first purchase to
        receipts, failures, support, and budgeting.
      </p>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>Content last reviewed: {CONTENT_REVIEWED}</span>
        <span>Reading time: about 14 minutes</span>
        <span>Independent educational content</span>
      </div>
      <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <strong>On this page</strong>
        <ol>
